# RepoMentor Code Ownership
# Lines starting with '#' are comments.
# Each line is a file pattern followed by one or more owners.

# Global maintainers
*                   @your-org/repomentor-maintainers

# Frontend Next.js app
/apps/web/          @your-org/frontend-maintainers

# API Gateway & Worker
/apps/api/          @your-org/backend-maintainers
/apps/worker/       @your-org/backend-maintainers

# Core domain logic (RAG, AST, Memory, Providers)
/packages/core/     @your-org/core-maintainers

# Database schemas & migrations
/packages/db/       @your-org/backend-maintainers

# Documentation & AI Agent Rules
/docs/              @your-org/docs-maintainers
/AGENTS.md          @your-org/core-maintainers
/.agent/            @your-org/core-maintainers

